WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,790
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:04,565
A muddy blob is sneaking up to the lemonade stand at night!

3
00:00:05,365 --> 00:00:08,015
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:08,815 --> 00:00:10,180
This is Episode 48.

5
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:11,920
Maya is asleep.

6
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,590
The owl is awake.

7
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:15,785
It knows who belongs here.

8
00:00:16,585 --> 00:00:17,515
The blob does not.

9
00:00:18,315 --> 00:00:20,680
The owl points, and the blob rolls away.

10
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,990
The magnifying glass checks the wall every day.

11
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:27,260
It finds a tiny crack before trouble does.

12
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,950
The little lamp looks through the papers.

13
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:31,605
One has a heart.

14
00:00:32,405 --> 00:00:33,415
That one is private.

15
00:00:34,215 --> 00:00:36,270
Each friend pins a note on the big board.

16
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:38,645
Three notes, one board.

17
00:00:39,445 --> 00:00:40,415
Red goes first.

18
00:00:41,215 --> 00:00:41,690
Morning.

19
00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:44,590
Maya reads the board and fixes the crack.

20
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:46,545
That is the night watch.

21
00:00:47,345 --> 00:00:51,220
Now you know GuardDuty, Inspector, Macie and Security Hub!

22
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,975
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

23
00:00:54,775 --> 00:00:55,715
Link in the bio.

24
00:00:56,515 --> 00:00:57,505
See you next time!
